# AMR Fleet Management Simulator - Capability Audit Report

**Date:** August 31, 2026  
**Repository:** `Surendhar-Prince/AMR_FLEET_MANAGEMENT`  
**Current State:** Verified & Operational (35/35 unit tests passing)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

The project is currently a **minimal 3D Autonomous Mobile Robot (AMR) simulator**. It provides an interactive 3D browser visualizer, shortest-path road navigation, basic node blocking, and REST/WebSocket APIs. 

However, it operates with **manual task assignment** and has **no dynamic routing or deadlock resolution algorithms (such as CBBA)**.

---

## 2. Feature Matrix

| Feature Domain | Feature Name | Status | Technical Details |
| :--- | :--- | :---: | :--- |
| **Visualization** | 3D Warehouse Canvas | ✅ **Present** | Built with React + Three.js (`viewer/src/Scene.jsx`). |
| | Robot Poses & Wheel Spin | ✅ **Present** | Dynamic heading rotation and real-time angular wheel rotation. |
| | Interactive Camera | ✅ **Present** | OrbitControls (zoom, pan, rotate). |
| | UI Dispatch Buttons | ❌ **Missing** | Viewer is read-only; orders must be submitted via REST API. |
| **Routing & Motion** | Graph-based Maps | ✅ **Present** | Defined in `maps/*.json` as nodes and directed edges. |
| | Static Shortest Path | ✅ **Present** | Calculated once at dispatch using `networkx.shortest_path`. |
| | Dynamic Detours / Rerouting | ❌ **Missing** | Robots will not take alternative routes when paths are congested. |
| **Collision & Safety** | SAT Bounding Box Check | ✅ **Present** | Separating Axis Theorem detects physical overlaps (`backend/collision.py`). |
| | Node Wait Check | ✅ **Present** | Robot waits if target node is occupied (`_is_next_node_blocked`). |
| | **Deadlock Prevention / Yielding** | ❌ **Missing** | Robots facing each other on bidirectional tracks freeze permanently. |
| **Task Allocation** | Manual API Dispatch | ✅ **Present** | `POST /api/orders` specifying explicit `amr_id` and `target_node`. |
| | **CBBA Consensus Allocation** | ❌ **Missing** | No peer-to-peer auction/consensus bidding for autonomous task bundles. |
| | Central Autonomous Dispatcher | ❌ **Missing** | No automated queue assignment for idle robots. |
| **Robot Subsystems** | Battery / SOC Simulation | ❌ **Missing** | No energy depletion, charging stations, or low-battery return. |
| | Cargo / Payload State | ❌ **Missing** | No capacity, pick/drop cargo logic, or pallet stations. |
| **Networking** | WebSocket Telemetry | ✅ **Present** | Low-latency 50Hz broadcast to browser (`backend/server.py`). |
| | Multi-Machine UDP Beacon | ✅ **Present** | LAN broadcasting for distributed instances (`backend/beacon.py`). |

