## 4. Recommended Roadmap to Autonomy

1. **Implement CBBA Engine**: Add decentralized task bidding so any published task is claimed by the optimal robot.
2. **Implement Deadlock Prevention**: Add reservation tables / token-based lane yielding to prevent head-on standstills.
3. **Add Interactive Dispatch UI**: Add click-to-dispatch controls in the React frontend.
